Package: Friedman
Title: Data Relationship Explorer
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Arish", "Bhatti", email = "arish.bhatti@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A simple package meant to assist with exploring variable relationships within datasets.
             This package includes functions for identifying correlations, locating relationships within data based on correlation strength,
             creating scatter plots, and examining results.
